    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple key provider backed by a fixed 256-bit key. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Suitable for unit tests and single-node deployments. For production use provide a custom <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_i_encryption_key_provider" kindref="compound">IEncryptionKeyProvider</ref></computeroutput> that retrieves key material from a secrets management service.</para>
<para>Thread-safe: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_static_key_provider_1afd4c895d1be6f5acad162a4eba53c2bc" kindref="member">currentKey()</ref></computeroutput> is const and reads an immutable field. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
